WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A target drifts back and forth; the dashed line shows where it really is at each moment.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A noisy sensor reports its position, and on about one step in five it reports nothing.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.500
The filter's track follows the target, and the shaded band around it shows how unsure it is.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Where readings drop out the band widens, and the next reading pulls it tight again.
